identifier: Parsek
name: Parsek
abstract: >-
  Time-rewind mission recording and logistics. Record missions, return to an earlier time,
  and watch them play out alongside you while you fly new ones.
description: >-
  Parsek changes a lot of KSP's internal systems (career, contracts, crew, saves, time warp,
  vessels). Most other mods are not supported; see the Supported Mods list on GitHub.
license: MIT
$kref: '#/ckan/github/vl3c/Parsek/asset_match/^Parsek-v.+\.zip$'
$vref: '#/ckan/ksp-avc'
resources:
  homepage: https://forum.kerbalspaceprogram.com/topic/229943-1125-parsek-public-beta-time-rewind-mission-recording-logistics/
  repository: https://github.com/vl3c/Parsek
tags:
  - plugin
  - convenience
depends:
  - name: Harmony2
  - name: ClickThroughBlocker
  - name: ToolbarController
